-- Hand-written from here down. Everything above is `drizzle-kit generate`
-- output and must stay that way; these four kinds of statement have no
-- Drizzle expression and are the only hand-written SQL in the harness
-- besides the `CREATE EXTENSION vector` line at the top of 0000_init.sql.
